		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=1802&amp;p=15505#p15505"><![CDATA[
Those MMDVM error messages are nothing to do with the radio or its firmware, they are indicating a problem with your internet connection. The data is arriving too slowly and is resulting in lost data packets and hence lost speech. <br><br>It could be due to your internet connection or the server you are connected to. It might be worth choosing a different server.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Wed Aug 11, 2021 1:38 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
